  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance and Emergency Preparedness (IRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen lifesaving assistance delivery for internally displaced persons (IDP) and/or drought affected communities through equitable, effective and efficient Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance program ensuring vulnerable households receive coordinated, inclusive, and timely support to meet their survival basic needs. It is also to preposition and provide emergency shelter and non-food Items for the IDPS.</narrative>
  </description>
